{
  "id": "JHN.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 17",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghamwaash ghawooda aba badayda ginealangaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niihiit Yesu rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu, goong'weersa humng'eeda ak gwayi, “Bwaabwa, nigul damanda; aghaambiida Orjeedaang'u, ak abeeda eara Orjeeda ghoaghaambiinyi ang'iing'i, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba ghayi giidawi niny uurda aba badahuuka buuneassean ak abeeda ghoadaw eaweega manda muudeanooda fugiga sean ghayi iidawiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eaweega manda muudeanooda ea nih gil, gideaba ghwanalnyi ang'iing'eeda was ASEETA huumwa ea Yesu Gristoyda ghayi iijeagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini naaghaambiicheey aba badayda ng'eanyiida, ak ea naahiichi gadiyeeda ghayi igoonyean dasin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi ghamneawa, aghaambiidaan Bwaabwa, aba madeadaang'u aba gheambalmeeda ghayi eandeawi sea ang'iing'i nea miyeesin ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naanung' ghwanalnyi fuga ghayi igoonyean aba jeeda ng'eanyiida; ghayi fugaagu gil amadu gigoonyean aniini ghoah fugeasu, ak ghamneawa saawa ea niing'waay ng'asheandaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa saawa ea ninal gideaba haleanjeeda sean igoonyean gwaleabu headaang'u; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aniini naadawji ng'asheega ghayi igoonyean, ak saawa ea niing'waay ak ghwanal huumeanda gideaba aniini gealeabu headaang'u; ak ea nimwas gideaba ang'iing'i giijeaknean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaamwaashchi ASEETA aba saawa; maamwaashi ASEETA aba ng'eanyiida ghaamwaashchi aba badahuuka fuga igoonyean, aba gideaba gaagu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geasu sean gaagu gil, nea gaagu ea geasu, ak geakghaambiidan aba jeenyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa aniini ea mudu danda jeeda ng'eanyiida, amaduuku saawa gwanda jeeda ng'eanyiida nea ghaawunyi headaang'u. Bwaabeeda Ghaydit, ahaaghwana saawa aba gheawungaagu ghayi igoonyean, ahaaghwana ea ghoah agi nea gawuurji gissiwoosti aseasa gilagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi nea gutandeawa saawa iissa ghaahaaghwi aba gheawungaagu ghayi igooni; aniini naahaaghwi saawa ak ghanyea manda nih niroat eara akaleala geaghus orjeeda ghayi was roodaneeda, gwasa ng'asheega rugu ng'ooruutka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ghaawunyi headaang'u; ak ea nearukuti ng'asheesu aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, ak abeeda ghwanyas hooseaneegeasu muuchi aba jeesinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini naadawji ng'asheandaang'u; amahit ghwasit ng'eanyiida aba gideaba saawa maba ng'eanyiida, gawuurji gidameabeaheatani aniini ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini maamwaashi gideaba geandeawana jeeda ng'eanyiida, geagasayi gideaba gayfura aba gidida muyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saawa maba ng'eanyiida gawuurji gidameabeaheatani aniini ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiini saawa aba huumeanda aba gideaba ng'asheandaang'u huumwa gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gidaghayi iijeakteaydanean jeeda ng'eanyiida, gwasunu eara aniini neajeakti saawa gaweay jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu ea naamiidu geaw aniini aba badahuuka nyaawa, ak abeeda eara saawa geamiidu aba huumeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Maamwaashi ASEETA aba suh ak ghwahit, ghamwaashi eara aba giika jea ghamwasan aba ng'asheanda nyaawaan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda ghoah fiisu gilagi; gawuurji gidindeati jeedeanyu ang'iing'i Bwaabwa, nea geandi aniini jeadaang'u, eara saawa goobiida jeedeanya, ak abeeda ghamwas ng'eanyiida gideaba guwoosi siida ghayi ajeaknean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini naadawji saawa giigheambiita ghayi igoonyeaniin ak abeeda ghoah gilagi gawuurji gissiwoosti aseasa gilagi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aniini gaydeabiida jeenyaawa nea giibiidi ang'iing'i jeedeanyu; gideabali geemajeek ak ghoah gilagi ak abeeda ghwanal ng'eanyiida gideaba ghayi giijeaknean ea gideaba gibwariinyi saawa gawuurji gida ibwariiydanaan aniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwaabwa, suh ghayi igoonyeaniin geagasayi dandeawa galeagasean aba hiji eandi sean, ak abeeda ghwadaah giigheambiiteanyu ghayi igoonyean, aba bariinyeagaagu nea miyeebwat sindeeta ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea Bwaabeeda doabiiwaat, ng'eanyiida mwanalnyi, duuku aniini ghaanaleay; eara suh ghwanal gideaba ghayi giijeaknean ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea naanung' ghwanal gheawungaagu, ak gaydanung' ghwanal, abeeda bariinyeega ghayi ibwariinyaan aniiniin goobiida jeesinga nyaawa, ak geabiidi aniini jeenyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
